From 6b7ab2b1e6114eff4ec58c11a03548ca9cbf0d0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 07:04:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Rename the CLI from ahterm to termsurf

Name the app executable termsurf, so the CLI Homebrew links onto PATH
is termsurf. The CLI's own usage text and the shell-integration ssh
wrappers now run termsurf, which also fixes the wrappers, which pointed
at a ghostboard executable the bundle does not contain.
---
